# Slash of Light deals damage equal to the creatures plus the Equipment its caster controls, counted as it resolves (the
# ruling, CR 608.2h): Bot1's Ornithopter and Memnite and its Paradise Mantle make 3, so Bot2's Yoked Ox (0/4) is left
# with 3 damage and lives. Bot1's Mox Pearl is an artifact but no Equipment, and Bot2's own creatures and Equipment are
# not counted. "Target creature" refuses a player.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Paradise Mantle
Ornithopter
Memnite
Slash of Light
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Yoked Ox
Ornithopter
Paradise Mantle
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Yoked Ox.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Slash of Light.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Hand.Slash of Light.Cast(Yoked Ox)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Yoked Ox.Damage = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Yoked Ox.Damage = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Slash of Light
